{"metadata":{"externalID":"s:11WorldModule0A0V17advanceChangeTickAA0dE0VyF","symbolKind":"method","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"advanceChangeTick"},{"kind":"text","text":"() -> "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"ChangeTick","preciseIdentifier":"s:11WorldModule10ChangeTickV"}],"roleHeading":"Instance Method","modules":[{"name":"WorldModule"}],"remoteSource":{"fileName":"World.swift","url":"https:\/\/github.com\/Tyler-Keith-Thompson\/ECS\/blob\/main\/Sources\/WorldModule\/World.swift#L198"},"role":"symbol","title":"advanceChangeTick()"},"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/World\/advanceChangeTick()"},"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"abstract":[{"text":"Starts a new change tick, so components added or changed from now on are newer than every","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"earlier tick.","type":"text"}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/worldmodule\/world\/advancechangetick()"]}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/World"]]},"seeAlsoSections":[{"title":"Detecting Changes","identifiers":["doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/World\/changeTick","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/World\/lastRun"],"anchor":"Detecting-Changes","generated":true}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"platforms":["Linux"],"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"text":"@discardableResult","kind":"attribute"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"mutating","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"advanceChangeTick","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"() -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"ChangeTick","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:11WorldModule10ChangeTickV","identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/ChangeTick"}]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"anchor":"return-value","type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Return Value"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The new tick."}]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"level":2,"anchor":"discussion","type":"heading","text":"Discussion"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Use this method to mark a point in the world’s history. Afterward, a filter such as","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/QueryFilter\/changed(_:since:)-swift.type.method","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" with the earlier tick finds exactly","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the components changed since that point. The following example changes one entity’s","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"health after a checkpoint and then finds it:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["var world = World()","world.spawn(Health(current: 10))","let hero = world.spawn(Health(current: 10))","","let checkpoint = world.changeTick","world.advanceChangeTick()","world[Health.self, of: hero].current -= 1","","let changed = world.query(Health.self).changed(Health.self, since: checkpoint)","print(changed.map(\\.entity) == [hero])","\/\/ Prints \"true\""],"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"A schedule calls this method before each system it runs.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"style":"note","type":"aside","name":"Complexity","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"O(1), plus the cost of refreshing the world’s value indexes, if it has any."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]}],"sections":[],"kind":"symbol","references":{"doc://WorldModule/documentation/WorldModule/World/advanceChangeTick()":{"title":"advanceChangeTick()","url":"\/documentation\/worldmodule\/world\/advancechangetick()","role":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Starts a new change tick, so